egin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{4x-{x}^{2}-3}}\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)\\sqrt{1-(x-2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-df0b2a58-e387-57a4-9854-4e28d5375adf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-df0b2a58-e387-57a4-9854-4e28d5375adf" :answer-field/id #uuid "df0b2a58-e387-57a4-9854-4e28d5375adf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c4f80582-298f-5c90-a10b-ebd361c7f1f1" "answer-954d732f-c8a8-5401-9ea5-cff879834dee" "answer-238150d5-412c-5e4f-8ec7-0e1a8fc47b07" "answer-682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" "answer-b1d2650d-b9f4-5aa7-8e6f-ae3401a2951c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4f80582-298f-5c90-a10b-ebd361c7f1f1" :answer/id #uuid "c4f80582-298f-5c90-a10b-ebd361c7f1f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-954d732f-c8a8-5401-9ea5-cff879834dee" :answer/id #uuid "954d732f-c8a8-5401-9ea5-cff879834dee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-238150d5-412c-5e4f-8ec7-0e1a8fc47b07" :answer/id #uuid "238150d5-412c-5e4f-8ec7-0e1a8fc47b07" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" :answer/id #uuid "682c1810-2a8d-5ae9-ab98-90e3455933f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{arsech}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b1d2650d-b9f4-5aa7-8e6f-ae3401a2951c" :answer/id #uuid "b1d2650d-b9f4-5aa7-8e6f-ae3401a2951c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-87c6c320-8ad0-5a7a-8ea7-78e763a7875c" :question/id #uuid "87c6c320-8ad0-5a7a-8ea7-78e763a7875c" :question/math-academy-id "q-97781" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{3}{|3x+1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}+6x+10}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square for the argument of the square root in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{x}^{2}+6x+10 & =9({x}^{2}+\\frac{2}{3}x+\\frac{10}{9}) \\\\  & =9({x}^{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}x+{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}-{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}+\\frac{10}{9}) \\\\  & =9[{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}+1]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{|3x+1|\\sqrt{9{x}^{2}+6x+10}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{9[1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}]}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x+\\frac{1}{3}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|x+\\frac{1}{3}|\\sqrt{1+{(x+\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{1+{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(x+\\frac{1}{3})+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8e035c3a-1daf-5a2e-a5be-43c121a2a65e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8e035c3a-1daf-5a2e-a5be-43c121a2a65e" :answer-field/id #uuid "8e035c3a-1daf-5a2e-a5be-43c121a2a65e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-fb8e96b0-33c1-525d-a438-9b2176a1d06e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5cbbfe99-40b4-5a39-acb5-22411fdbd