cube." :question/worked-solution "Since the volume of a cube is \n\n$$\nV={s}^{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ is the length of an edge, we can find $s$ as follows:\n\n$$\ns=\\sqrt[3]{V}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{8}{27}}=\\frac{2}{3}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length of the edges is $\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\text{yd}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4862371a-c7ed-5ad0-9014-0bebc76f26f4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4862371a-c7ed-5ad0-9014-0bebc76f26f4" :answer-field/id #uuid "4862371a-c7ed-5ad0-9014-0bebc76f26f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c4be238d-21bb-523f-8eb3-52d86aa73d5e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-96aaa99e-4502-51ec-b979-dfbad980644d" "answer-c4be238d-21bb-523f-8eb3-52d86aa73d5e" "answer-be1e9eab-e11a-5125-b65e-907dffe78488" "answer-e1f05b30-0f63-5438-99a3-75f5fa7a6c45" "answer-c66a3a21-4930-57d9-9299-a633aff26b16"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-96aaa99e-4502-51ec-b979-dfbad980644d" :answer/id #uuid "96aaa99e-4502-51ec-b979-dfbad980644d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\,\\text{yd}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4be238d-21bb-523f-8eb3-52d86aa73d5e" :answer/id #uuid "c4be238d-21bb-523f-8eb3-52d86aa73d5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\text{yd}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be1e9eab-e11a-5125-b65e-907dffe78488" :answer/id #uuid "be1e9eab-e11a-5125-b65e-907dffe78488" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\,\\text{yd}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1f05b30-0f63-5438-99a3-75f5fa7a6c45" :answer/id #uuid "e1f05b30-0f63-5438-99a3-75f5fa7a6c45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\,\\text{yd}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c66a3a21-4930-57d9-9299-a633aff26b16" :answer/id #uuid "c66a3a21-4930-57d9-9299-a633aff26b16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\text{yd}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-62d14dcd-2286-5ac0-9da8-8fd4144e472b" :question/id #uuid "62d14dcd-2286-5ac0-9da8-8fd4144e472b" :question/math-academy-id "q-118657" :question/problem "Each side of a cubic room has length $\\frac{7}{2}\\,\\text{yd}.$ What is the volume of the room?" :question/worked-solution "We need to find the volume of a cube.\n\nThe volume $V$ of a cube can be found using the formula\n\n$$\nV={s}^{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ is the side length of the cube.\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{7}{2}\\,\\text{yd}$ into the formula, we get \n\n$$\nV={(\\frac{7}{2}\\,\\text{yd})}^{3}=\\frac{343}{8}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the room is $\\frac{343}{8}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-54f0d882-e045-51e5-805a-be34d10addf7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-54f0d882-e045-51e5-805a-be34d10addf7" :answer-field/id #uuid "54f0d882-e045-51e5-805a-be34d10addf7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-61d84e0f-46af-534f-97ed-8a837fc6090c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-66f75452-5479-556a-a5d0-d9bcd562286f" "answer-2e1043c4-9142-52b2-8992-91ad1d63e682" "answer-61d84e0f-46af-534f-97ed-8a837fc6090c" "answer-868508cb-90da-5e04-b5e6-299a168b5301" "answer-536a338a-3b08-561d-b437-b32195834bf5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66f75452-5479-556a-a5d0-d9bcd562286f" :answer/id #uuid "66f75452-5479-556a-a5d0-d9bcd562286f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{21}{12}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e1043c4-9142-52b2-8992-91ad1d63e682" :answer/id #uuid "2e1043c4-9142-52b2-8992-91ad1d63e682" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{21}{2}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-61d84e0f-46af-534f-97ed-8a837fc6090c" :answer/id #uuid "61d84e0f-46af-534f-97ed-8a837fc6090c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{343}{8}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-868508cb-90da-5e04-b5e6-299a168b5301" :answer/id #uuid "868508cb-90da-5e04-b5e6-299a168b5301" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{49\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-536a338a-3b08-561d-b437-b32195834bf5" :answer/id #uuid "536a338a-3b08-561d-b437-b32195834bf5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{49}{4}\\,{\\text{yd}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-303cc00a-f8f7-5cb0-b148-e5fe2714f366" :question/id #uuid "303cc00a-f8f7-5cb0-b148-e5fe2714f366" :question/math-academy-id "q-107285" :question/problem "Six foam cubes has a combined volume of $162\\,{\\text{in}}^{3}.$ Find the side length of a single cube." :question/worked-solution "First, we find the volume of one foam cube:\n\n$$\n\\frac{162\\,{\\text{in}}^{3}}{6}=27\\,{\\text{in}}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we need to find the side length of one foam cube.\n\nSince the volume of a cube is \n\n$$\nV={s}^{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ is the length of a side, we can find $s$ as follows:\n\n$$\ns=\\sqrt[3]{V}=\\sqrt[3]{27}=3\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length of a side is $3\\,\\text{in}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-87d480ee-3e1b-54f1-8d19-97972019a2dd"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-87d480ee-3e1b-54f1-8d19-97972019a2dd" :answer-field/id #uuid "87d480ee-3e1b-54f1-8d19-97972019a2dd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6c091aa2-9dff-543c-b652-0a3fcaefe0f4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b0c08d7e-2b79-58c7-890f-67efa847f736" "answer-59dd8486-f3ab-53ba-9fb8-1ad3b4741f5d" "answer-6c091aa2-9dff-543c-b652-0a3fcaefe0f4" "answer-e8c65057-eeb3-52a7-8662-be872532a204" "answer-949d18c3-9fad-59cf-bdf3-a6e5a5fd756c"] :db/e